m] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]202608/test_suite_tier1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-fp.8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-fp/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase-fp.8.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Load- and machine-normalized contract-set budget guard[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]budget[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]budget: replace the wall-clock ceiling in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test_contract_set_serial_runtime_stays_within_budget with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]calibration-probe-normalized CPU measurement, so the guard bounds the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract set's size instead of the host's load, and settle sase-fp.2's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deferred contract-set membership question with the re-measured headroom.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Change-scoped false-negative correlation[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]correlate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]correlate: record the workspace and change-set identity that the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]false-negative definition requires on full-run health records, restrict [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]find_false_negatives to pairs that describe the same change, and re-read[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the metric.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Land epic sase-fp[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after budget, correlate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: file the collected follow-ups with /sase_new_task, close sase-fp [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a note covering the verification and integration findings, run